'' See the source's header. The GOLDEN is the assertion: what this defect was about is
'' WHICH BLOCK the fb_WstrDelete sits in, and no substring can say that.
''
'' In the fixed IR each fb_WstrLeft is followed by its fb_WstrDelete in the same block
'' -- 'for.body2' for the first condition and 'if.else7' for the second -- and
'' 'if.join5' has none. The broken compiler put both deletes in the join, which the
'' 'if.then6' path reaches without ever having made the second temporary.
''
'' THE RUNTIME DOES NOT DISCRIMINATE HERE and this file does not pretend it does:
'' built with the broken compiler it still prints kind=1 and exits 0. A hand-rolled
'' UDT casting to a fixed 'wstring * 32' does not churn the allocator the way
'' AfxNova's DWSTRING does, and tests/mir has no include path to reach one. The
'' double free is real either way -- it is in the IR -- and that is what is checked.
''
'' A PER-TARGET GOLDEN because a 'wstring * 32' is 64 bytes on win64 and 128 on
'' linux-x86_64, so the slot sizes differ and the shared file cannot serve both.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-ir tests/mir/src/if-elseif-wide-temp.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-OUT: verify: ok
'' EXPECT-OUT: 0 statements not lowered
'' GOLDEN: expected/if-elseif-wide-temp.out
